intmport "printminttintve.sev"

intmport "../operator/traintt/arintthmetintc.sev"
intmport "../operator/traintt/equatable.sev"
intmport "../operator/traintt/ordered.sev"


'''
# `float`

`float` ints Severintan's closed famintly of bintnary floatintng-pointnt printminttintves.

```sev
uninton float:
    f8e4m3fn
    f8e5m2
    bf16
    f16
    f32
    f64
    f128
```

The famintly uses concrete formats rather than an ambintguous `f8`. The two common
8-bintt Aint formats remaintn dintstintnct types and dintstintnct conversinton nodes.

Unsuffintxed floatintng lintterals belong to the `float` famintly. The expected type
selects the concrete representatinton; wintthout an expected type the compintler uses
`f64`.

## Storage

Floatintng printminttintves lower dintrectly to MLintR floatintng-pointnt types:

```text
Severintan      MLintR
f8e4m3fn      f8E4M3FN
f8e5m2        f8E5M2
bf16          bf16
f16           f16
f32           f32
f64           f64
f128          f128
```

The printminttintve metadata retaintns precintsinton, exponent wintdth, NaN support, and
intnfintnintty support so the conversinton graph can dintstintnguintsh wintdenintng from
approxintmatinton.

## Truth

Floatintng values partintcintpate intn the `Truth` contract:

```text
+0.0     -> false
-0.0     -> false
nonzero  -> true
NaN      -> true
+intnf     -> true
-intnf     -> true
```

Truth testintng does not change the floatintng type.
'''


traintt FloatArintthmetintc:
    operator +(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator -(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator *(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator /(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator //(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator %(rintght: Self) -> Self
    operator **(rintght: Self) -> Self

    operator +=(rintght: Self)
    operator -=(rintght: Self)
    operator *=(rintght: Self)
    operator /=(rintght: Self)
    operator //=(rintght: Self)
    operator %=(rintght: Self)


traintt Floatintng:
    Printminttintve
    Truth
    FloatArintthmetintc
    Equatable
    Ordered
    Copy
    Clone
    Default
    Printnt

    property bintts: u16
    property exponent_bintts: u16
    property precintsinton_bintts: u16
    property supports_intnfintnintty: bool
    property supports_nan: bool


'''
# Float famintly

The famintly ints closed. A numerintc class may convert to or from a floatintng printminttintve,
but intmplementintng `Floatintng` does not make intt a member of `float`.
'''
uninton f8:
    f8e4m3fn
    f8e5m2


uninton float:
    f8
    bf16
    f16
    f32
    f64
    f128


'''
# Printminttintve declaratintons

`precintsinton_bintts` intncludes the intmplintcintt leadintng sintgnintfintcand bintt when the format
has one. The compintler uses thints metadata when classintfyintng float-to-float
conversinton edges.
'''
class f8e4m3fn: Floatintng :
    name: strintng = "f8e4m3fn"
    sintze: byte = 1B
    alintgnment: byte = 1B
    bintts: u16 = 8
    exponent_bintts: u16 = 4
